Package: workload-collector
Version: 0.1.0
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Maintainer: Konstantin Rasputin <rasputyashka@users.noreply.github.com>
Architecture: all
Depends: python3 (>= 3.11), systemd, init-system-helpers, ca-certificates
Homepage: https://github.com/rasputyashka/testdatacollector
Description: Linux system metrics HTTP sender
 Collect CPU, memory, filesystem and network metrics and deliver JSON reports
 to an HTTP(S) collector. Runs as an unprivileged systemd service with a
 persistent installation identity and TOML configuration.
